This patch series is in preparation of adding DMA support to the AACI
driver.

I'd appreciate it if ALSA people could do me the curtesy of copying me
on patches they dream up on ALSA drivers maintained by me, rather than
running rough-shod over work that they may have queued - especially
when they say "you can also do this" "yes I know, I have a patch" and
then they do it anyway.

If this is how they want to operate, I'll avoid working on any ALSA
stuff in the future.  Its just not worth me wasting my time.
